msgid ""
"Find cut locations, given a maximum of 4 qubits per subcircuit. This circuit"
" can be separated in two by making a single wire cut and cutting one "
"`CRZGate` {#find-cut-locations-given-a-maximum-of-4-qubits-per-subcircuit-"
"this-circuit-can-be-separated-in-two-by-making-a-single-wire-cut-and-"
"cutting-one-crzgate}"
msgstr ""
"Encontrar las ubicaciones de los cortes, dado un máximo de 4 qubits por "
"subcircuito. Este circuito puede separarse en dos realizando un único corte "
"de hilo y cortando una `CRZGate` {#find-cut-locations-given-a-maximum-"
"of-4-qubits-per-subcircuit-this-circuit-can-be-separated-in-two-by-making-a-"
"single-wire-cut-and-cutting-one-crzgate}"

